Z||000008||sloth85GT||11-17-2001||06:02 PM||||I LOVE that license plate!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I want one I want one lol 'cept I don't know if the insurance people would let me get away with that......kinda iffy. <P>I used to be a huge fan of Mustangs, I would drop my jaw to every 5.0 I saw. Don't worry guys, I've already done my 2000 Hail Mary's. But I still CAN appreciate a mustang, my favorites are the '96, the newer body, with the old 5.0 motor. I don't get the 4.6 though? why go smaller from the 302 to the 281? I dunno, anyway....they're okay in my book. <P>I think the reason there's a little bit of a feud between the Fieros and the Mustangs is cause once a Fiero can beat a Mustang, we're happy. Mustangs are like goals for us to reach I think. Cause I know that the first day I get my 350 in the car, I'm headed out to go look for a Stang to kick! <P>A pair of nice cars, but sorry Blackstang, I like the Fiero better.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.mts.net/~kuzma/fieronl.gif">     <BR>Dan<BR>1985 Silver GT||||reg||1
